            </note>
            <note corresp="#d550-f4" n="7" xml:id="d550-f4-content">
                <p>Economic Warfare Division of the Embassy in London.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d550-f5" n="8" xml:id="d550-f5-content">
