            </note>
            <note corresp="#d550-f6" n="9" xml:id="d550-f6-content">
                <p>In telegram 381, January 15, 1944, to London, the Department expressed approval
                    of suggested approach to the Swedish Legation (840.48 Refugees/4979).</p>
            </note>
